  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency life-saving WASH, winterization and education services for the most vulnerable children and communities affected by the earthquake in T&#xFC;rkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s objective is to provide life-saving WASH, NFI and education supplies, for more than 139,000 children and their families in affected areas (in Kahramanmara&#x15F;, Hatay, Gaziantep, Kilis, Osmaniye, Malatya, Ad&#x131;yaman, Diyarbak&#x131;r, &#x15E;anl&#x131;urfa, Adana). The proposed activities include distribution of WASH supplies (collapsible water containers, Hygiene kits), winter clothes for 0-14 years old and Electrical Heaters (NFI) and learning and playing materials (My Playbox kits, school in a box, recreational kits and individual school bags and stationery for children).</narrative>
  </description>
